      "text": "Endo specimen runs: Endo to Labs\n   12:00am, 2:00pm, 4:30pm\n\nO2 restock: from the O2 Room\n   12:00am and 7:00pm, next floor in rotation\n   A, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, back to A\n   ED not included, except CDU\n\nDepartments can request extra runs anytime",
